DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       mmrrffttooppbbmm converts an MRF image to PBM format.

       mmrrffttooppbbmm takes the MRF image from the file named by the _i_n_p_u_t_._m_r_f argu‐
       ment, or Standard Input if you don't  specify  _i_n_p_u_t_._m_r_f.   The  output
       goes to Standard Output.

       For more information about mrf, see tthhee MMRRFF specification" (1).


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       In  addition  to  the options common to all programs based on libnetpbm
       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common Options ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ ), mmrrffttooppbbmm  recognizes  the
       following command line option:



       --aa     causes mmrrffttooppbbmm to include the edges, if any, in the output PBM.
              This may help when debugging a compressor's edge optimization.



